[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3240.549, "timestamp": "00:54:00", "text": "等等，你知道，这里有厕所。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3243.03, "timestamp": "00:54:03", "text": "不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3246.87, "timestamp": "00:54:06", "text": "我们又回到了这个地区。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3251.19, "timestamp": "00:54:11", "text": "等等，我这是在哪儿？ 我一会儿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3252.87, "timestamp": "00:54:12", "text": "上上下下，一会儿左转，一会儿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3273.43, "timestamp": "00:54:33", "text": "，我又回到入口处了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3287.829, "timestamp": "00:54:47", "text": "七夕是什么意思？ 七夕节在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3290.15, "timestamp": "00:54:50", "text": "萨尔节期间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3294.23, "timestamp": "00:54:54", "text": "关于这件事，民间传说里有很多故事。 呃，或者还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3297.51, "timestamp": "00:54:57", "text": "另一个人，我忘了名字。"}]